@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

actor "用户" as User
component "物理键盘" as Keyboard
component "Fcitx5\n输入法框架" as Fcitx
component "Voime addon（voime.so）\n输入法引擎 + PTT + commit" as Addon
component "voimed\nASR 守护进程" as Daemon
component "voime TUI\n可选监视器" as Tui
component "目标应用\nWayland text-input / XWayland XIM" as App
component "本地模型包\nFireRedVAD / FireRedASR2-CTC / FireRedPunc" as Models
component "麦克风" as Mic
component "Fcitx 配置\naddon / inputmethod / voime.conf" as Config

User --> Keyboard : 按键
Keyboard --> Fcitx : 输入事件
Fcitx --> Addon : InputContextKeyEvent\nPreInputMethod
Addon --> Fcitx : setPreedit(partial)\nupdateUserInterface(InputPanel)
Addon --> Fcitx : commitString(final)
Fcitx --> App : 普通按键 / 最终文本
Addon <--> Daemon : Unix socket\nStart / Stop / Partial / Final
Daemon --> Mic : PCM
Daemon --> Models : 只读加载
Tui <--> Daemon : Unix socket\n快照 / 命令
Fcitx --> Config : 加载 addon / IM 条目

note right of Addon : Hotkey 按 Mode 在 PreInputMethod 阶段被消费；\n普通键继续由 Fcitx 路由，Voime 不抓键盘、不转发。
@enduml
